caelum (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.5.0.
    - Rain and snow reworked: continuous falling layers behind and in front
      of the landscape, wind slant, haze over the distance, rain shafts,
      darker rain clouds and wet ground; lightning only for thunderstorms.
    - Security: location detection over HTTPS (ipwho.is, ipapi.co fallback)
      with validated replies; coordinates sent to online services rounded to
      2 decimals; markup escaped; HTTPS-only requests with a size cap.
    - Removed the obsolete phone-compass bridge script.

 -- Juliowilly <jw.adamagaba@gmail.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:04:32 +0000

caelum (1.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.4.0.
    - Photographed landscapes along the horizon (plain with trees, mountains,
      sea; CC0 panoramas from Poly Haven), turning with the facing direction
      and relit by the sun and moon.
    - Settings: a Landscape choice replaces the Horizon Silhouette switch.
    - New screenshots.

